      "",
      "Cache multipliers relative to base input, per the published table:",
      "  5-minute cache write  1.25x     1-hour cache write  2.0x     cache read  0.1x",
      "",
      "effective_from is set to a floor date because the published page gives current",
      "prices only. No historical price change is known for these models across the",
      "range this database covers (from 2026-05-19). If a past rate change comes to",
      "light, add a dated entry and run `recost --from <date>`; existing rows keep",
      "their stored cost until then."
    ]
  },

